<title>UK: FHC sets 200 mln mark REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>FHC sets 200 mln mark REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK CENTRALBODEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON   **5.55	MATURITY    04.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  102.40    PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 DENOMS (K) 1	   GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR TWO YEARS, THEN ANNUAL FLOATING COUPON LINKED TO</p>
<p>		10-YEAR REX SUBINDEX, STARTING WITH 81 PCT OF 10-YR</p>
<p>		REX SUBINDEX IN YEAR 3, DECREASING BY ONE PCT EACH</p>
<p>		YEAR, ENDING WITH 74 PCT IN YEAR 10</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 715</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
